WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.090 --> 00:00:07.690
In The Expanse Season 5, Earth is ravaged
with asteroids sent by Marco Inaros, who leads

00:00:07.690 --> 00:00:11.769
a militant Belter rebellion against Earth
and Mars.

00:00:11.769 --> 00:00:15.690
Naomi is imprisoned by Marco and their son
Filip.

00:00:15.690 --> 00:00:20.580
She jumps through space to escape, and Alex
dies saving her.

00:00:20.580 --> 00:00:25.150
Amos and Clarissa fight to survive on an apocalyptic
Earth.

00:00:25.150 --> 00:00:30.800
Holden struggles to contain the protomolecule,
Fred Johnson is killed, and in the finale,

00:00:30.800 --> 00:00:37.050
a rogue Martian faction leaves the solar system
for a new world called Laconia, and one of

00:00:37.050 --> 00:00:41.410
their ships is destroyed by mysterious alien
entities.

00:00:41.410 --> 00:00:44.310
So – what’s going on here?

00:00:44.310 --> 00:00:49.830
This video has no spoilers from the books,
just stuff from the TV show up to Season 5.

00:00:49.830 --> 00:00:54.890
So for generations, the people of Mars have
worked to terraform the planet into a habitable

00:00:54.890 --> 00:00:57.539
world, with breathable air and life.

00:00:57.539 --> 00:01:03.630
But in Season 3, the alien Ring gates opened
up hundreds of already habitable worlds – planets

00:01:03.630 --> 00:01:07.180
like Ilus that have life and resources.

00:01:07.180 --> 00:01:11.659
So Mars is now obsolete, and people start
leaving.

00:01:11.659 --> 00:01:16.659
But Mars still has a heap of advanced military
gear lying around, and with its government

00:01:16.659 --> 00:01:19.700
in disarray, stuff goes missing.

00:01:19.700 --> 00:01:25.840
Bobbie and Alex discover a conspiracy in the
military to give Martian warships to Marco

00:01:25.840 --> 00:01:28.219
Inaros and his Free Navy.

00:01:28.219 --> 00:01:33.169
In return, Marco gives them the protomolecule
sample he steals from Fred.

00:01:33.169 --> 00:01:38.349
In the finale, we learn that this Martian
conspiracy is led by someone called “Admiral

00:01:38.349 --> 00:01:39.349
Duarte”.

00:01:39.349 --> 00:01:43.630
And Duarte’s Martians take a whole fleet
of ships and yeet outta the solar system through

00:01:43.630 --> 00:01:44.819
the Ring gate.

00:01:44.819 --> 00:01:50.100
Because they made a deal that Marco can have
the Sol system, while Duarte’s faction rule

00:01:50.100 --> 00:01:52.490
a system called Laconia.

00:01:52.490 --> 00:01:57.200
This has actually been hinted at all season,
if you zoom in on the opening credits it shows

00:01:57.200 --> 00:02:00.609
a Martian ship flying to Laconia.

00:02:00.609 --> 00:02:07.099
So on Laconia, Duarte has the scientist Cortázar
studying mysterious alien structures, and

00:02:07.099 --> 00:02:09.280
experimenting with the protomolecule.

00:02:09.280 --> 00:02:15.629
Remember, that billions of years ago, there
was an alien civilisation called the Builders.

00:02:15.629 --> 00:02:20.099
The Builders created the protomolecule as
a tool to build these Ring gates, [as a transport

00:02:20.099 --> 00:02:21.099
system].

00:02:21.099 --> 00:02:26.519
But the protomolecule also has the potential
to be a weapon, or to transform the human

00:02:26.519 --> 00:02:27.599
species.

00:02:27.599 --> 00:02:33.599
In Season 2, Cortázar said the protomolecule
“learns”, and “changes”, it “devours

00:02:33.599 --> 00:02:37.370
old constructs and recreates them”.

00:02:37.370 --> 00:02:42.969
Duarte and his Martians seem to want to recreate
the dream of Mars.

00:02:42.969 --> 00:02:49.010
A conspirator said “The dream of Mars isn’t
dead, it’s about to be writ large”.

00:02:49.010 --> 00:02:57.280
And Sauveterre says Mars is “a vision of
humanity that can encompass a thousand stars”.

00:02:57.280 --> 00:03:02.739
He says Laconia will be “pure” and unified,
strict and militant.

00:03:02.739 --> 00:03:09.640
The name Laconia refers to Sparta in ancient
Greece, renowned as a military society.

00:03:09.640 --> 00:03:14.519
So Duarte has started a whole new faction
of Martian military on the distant world of

00:03:14.519 --> 00:03:18.150
Laconia, empowered by alien technology.

00:03:18.150 --> 00:03:20.349
But they’re playing with fire.

00:03:20.349 --> 00:03:26.109
One of Duarte’s ships enters the Laconia
Ring, and is suddenly destroyed by mysterious

00:03:26.109 --> 00:03:28.109
alien entities.

00:03:28.109 --> 00:03:32.590
These are the creatures that killed the Builders
billions of years ago, using weapons like

00:03:32.590 --> 00:03:38.930
that artifact on Ilus – and now, these entities
are a threat to humans too.

00:03:38.930 --> 00:03:44.420
So Season 5 shatters the balance of power
in The Expanse, with Laconia splitting off

00:03:44.420 --> 00:03:51.450
from Mars, Earth devastated, Marco’s Free
Navy rising in the Belt, and strange aliens

00:03:51.450 --> 00:03:52.689
haunting the Ring gates.

00:03:52.689 --> 00:03:59.310
But at the same time as all this sci fi and
politics, this season is also deeply personal,

00:03:59.310 --> 00:04:05.319
with Amos, Naomi and Alex each going on journeys
to face their pasts.

00:04:05.319 --> 00:04:07.719
Amos grew up in Baltimore.

00:04:07.719 --> 00:04:14.329
As a child, his name was Timothy, and he was
sexually exploited as a child prostitute,

00:04:14.329 --> 00:04:17.180
then worked as muscle in organised crime.

00:04:17.180 --> 00:04:21.069
A woman named Lydia was like a mother to Timothy.

00:04:21.069 --> 00:04:26.790
She taught him that even if you’re not a
good person, you can still live like a good

00:04:26.790 --> 00:04:29.810
person, you can “pretend” to be “righteous”.

00:04:29.810 --> 00:04:34.009
Cause Amos doesn’t feel empathy for others.

00:04:34.009 --> 00:04:36.259
Hurting people makes him feel good.

00:04:36.259 --> 00:04:38.300
He can’t tell right from wrong.

00:04:38.300 --> 00:04:40.620
He’s a damaged person.

00:04:40.620 --> 00:04:48.669
But by following a guiding light like Lydia
or Naomi, Amos can learn to do the right thing,

00:04:48.669 --> 00:04:51.060
and live a good life.

00:04:51.060 --> 00:04:56.490
Lydia has died, so Amos pays his respects
to her husband, Charles, and then visits his

00:04:56.490 --> 00:04:58.400
old friend Erich.

00:04:58.400 --> 00:05:03.970
Back in the day, Timothy’s boss was Amos
Burton, and Burton ordered Timothy to kill

00:05:03.970 --> 00:05:04.970
Erich.

00:05:04.970 --> 00:05:10.930
Timothy killed Burton instead, and took Burton’s
identity to escape Earth and start a new life

00:05:10.930 --> 00:05:12.090
as Amos.

00:05:12.090 --> 00:05:18.080
Now, Erich is a crime boss himself, and Amos
gets him to provide housing for Charles.

00:05:18.080 --> 00:05:22.340
And before leaving Earth forever, Amos visits
Clarissa.

00:05:22.340 --> 00:05:26.889
In Season 3, Clarissa murdered a bunch of
people, trying to get revenge on Holden for

00:05:26.889 --> 00:05:28.639
imprisoning her father.

00:05:28.639 --> 00:05:31.370
But afterwards, Amos made friends with Clarissa.

00:05:31.370 --> 00:05:35.250
So he visits her in an underground prison
called the Pit.

00:05:35.250 --> 00:05:40.199
Clarissa is in a deep dark place, emotionally
and literally.

00:05:40.199 --> 00:05:46.490
So Amos helps and supports Clarissa, in the
same way that Naomi and Lydia helped him – which

00:05:46.490 --> 00:05:49.530
goes to show how much Amos has grown.

00:05:49.530 --> 00:05:54.220
While they’re in the Pit, one of Marco’s
asteroids hits America, and they have to work

00:05:54.220 --> 00:05:59.680
together to climb out of the darkness into
the light, like a metaphor for escaping their

00:05:59.680 --> 00:06:01.110
emotional pain.

00:06:01.110 --> 00:06:06.370
They also kick a cybernetically enhanced superthug
in the balls, which is a metaphor for kicking

00:06:06.370 --> 00:06:08.710
their emotional pain in the balls.

00:06:08.710 --> 00:06:14.810
Amos still isn’t good at this talking-about-your-feelings
stuff, so he’s almost glad when the world

00:06:14.810 --> 00:06:20.310
starts ending and they’ve gotta fight to
survive – violence he understands.

00:06:20.310 --> 00:06:26.990
Amos says that in times of conflict, human
groups fracture into small hostile tribes.

00:06:26.990 --> 00:06:32.040
But Clarissa has a more optimistic inclusive
perspective, and convinces Amos to help some

00:06:32.040 --> 00:06:34.389
refugees escape Earth.

00:06:34.389 --> 00:06:39.610
With the help of Erich, they find a ship and
fight some goons, and fly to safety on the

00:06:39.610 --> 00:06:40.610
moon.

00:06:40.610 --> 00:06:45.800
There, Erich asks Amos to come with him to
start a crime gang like the old days.

00:06:45.800 --> 00:06:51.860
But Amos rejects his dark past, and chooses
a more optimistic future – he brings Clarissa

00:06:51.860 --> 00:06:58.490
to join the Roci crew, arguing that even murderous
enemies can become trusted friends.

00:06:58.490 --> 00:07:06.139
So Amos suffered terrible trauma and violence,
and he can never fully escape that past.

00:07:06.139 --> 00:07:11.400
But he can learn to be better, and help others
to be better too.

00:07:11.400 --> 00:07:16.360
Amos survives the churn by growing his tribe.

00:07:16.360 --> 00:07:18.789
Naomi also faces her past.

00:07:18.789 --> 00:07:24.250
Years ago, she was involved with Belter radicals
Marco, Cyn, and Karal.

00:07:24.250 --> 00:07:27.699
Naomi and Marco had a baby called Filip.

00:07:27.699 --> 00:07:34.220
Marco was passionate, and charismatic, but
was also an emotionally manipulative, narcissistic

00:07:34.220 --> 00:07:35.410
terrorist.

00:07:35.410 --> 00:07:40.879
He used some computer code that Naomi wrote
to blow up a ship called the Gamarra, killing

00:07:40.879 --> 00:07:42.860
five hundred people.

00:07:42.860 --> 00:07:49.300
Naomi was horrified and tried to leave, so
Marco took baby Filip away from her.

00:07:49.300 --> 00:07:54.449
Naomi became desperate and depressed, and
almost committed suicide out an airlock.

00:07:54.449 --> 00:08:00.750
She managed to start a new life, but always
felt guilty about the child she left behind.

00:08:00.750 --> 00:08:04.969
In Season 5, she and Filip finally reunite.

00:08:04.969 --> 00:08:11.199
Naomi hopes to save her son from being used
by Marco like she was – but Filip is loyal

00:08:11.199 --> 00:08:16.800
to his controlling father, and Naomi is imprisoned
on Marco’s ship.

00:08:16.800 --> 00:08:22.630
Series creator Ty Franck says Marco is like
the “bad guy version of Holden” – they’re

00:08:22.630 --> 00:08:27.470
both brave passionate leaders who fight for
what they believe in, but where Holden is

00:08:27.470 --> 00:08:34.040
selfless and compassionate and honest, Marco
is a selfish cruel liar and murderer, who

00:08:34.040 --> 00:08:38.210
commits the worst mass killing in history.

00:08:38.210 --> 00:08:40.510
Cyn is more friendly with Naomi.

00:08:40.510 --> 00:08:45.180
He was always a brotherly protective figure
to her, kind of like Amos.

00:08:45.180 --> 00:08:49.940
Naomi’s actress Dominique Tipper says that
that similarity might be what drew Naomi to

00:08:49.940 --> 00:08:52.170
Amos in the first place.

00:08:52.170 --> 00:08:59.020
Naomi tries desperately to convince Filip
to leave Marco, but he rejects her, and Naomi

00:08:59.020 --> 00:09:02.400
is again unable to save her son.

00:09:02.400 --> 00:09:08.150
So Naomi escapes by jumping through the vacuum
of space unprotected to another ship – which

00:09:08.150 --> 00:09:13.160
apparently is scientifically possible if you’re
quick, especially since Naomi injects herself

00:09:13.160 --> 00:09:15.320
with oxygenated blood.

00:09:15.320 --> 00:09:20.940
She suffers swelling and radiation burns,
and almost dies, but that’s just the beginning

00:09:20.940 --> 00:09:22.070
of her torment.

00:09:22.070 --> 00:09:27.400
Cause Naomi is stuck inside a trap designed
to lure and kill her friends.

00:09:27.400 --> 00:09:33.670
It’s a disabled ship with a fake distress
call, rigged to explode using Naomi’s own

00:09:33.670 --> 00:09:35.160
code from the Gamarra.

00:09:35.160 --> 00:09:39.880
It’s like Naomi’s past has been weaponised
to destroy her.

00:09:39.880 --> 00:09:45.180
But Naomi uses her skills and her grit to
survive this hellish trap.

00:09:45.180 --> 00:09:51.580
She leaps into space again to warn her friends
and is rescued by Alex and Bobbie.

00:09:51.580 --> 00:09:56.970
Alex goes back to Mars to reconnect with his
ex-wife and son, who he had left behind to

00:09:56.970 --> 00:09:58.630
go be a pilot.

00:09:58.630 --> 00:10:04.890
But his ex rejects him, and Alex has to accept
that some mistakes can’t be fixed.

00:10:04.890 --> 00:10:09.260
So he helps Bobbie investigate black market
Martian military gear.

00:10:09.260 --> 00:10:14.370
He talks to Sauveterre, and Babbage, who are
both secretly working for Duarte, and chase

00:10:14.370 --> 00:10:18.620
after the conspirators, and Bobbie does heroic
Bobbie things.

00:10:18.620 --> 00:10:23.080
Alex and Bobbie are both loyal Martians, and
they’re furious that the government they

00:10:23.080 --> 00:10:29.390
fought for has betrayed them – they grieve
that the dream of Mars is dying.

00:10:29.390 --> 00:10:33.270
When Naomi is in danger, they race in to save
her.

00:10:33.270 --> 00:10:38.550
Flying at a high-g burn is always dangerous
– they use the juice, to reduce the risk

00:10:38.550 --> 00:10:44.240
of stroke, but it’s always a roll of the
dice, and this time it goes against them,

00:10:44.240 --> 00:10:46.050
and Alex dies.

00:10:46.050 --> 00:10:50.860
Alex’s last words are “That was one hell
of a ride”.

00:10:50.860 --> 00:10:55.660
All he ever wanted was to fly and to fight
to do good with his crew.

00:10:55.660 --> 00:11:01.440
So dying to save Naomi after a crazy ride
in the Razorback is a fitting death for this

00:11:01.440 --> 00:11:04.260
Martian space cowboy.

00:11:04.260 --> 00:11:09.510
So while Amos Naomi and Alex go off on their
own journeys, Holden is alone.

00:11:09.510 --> 00:11:14.820
He’s lonely without his crew, but soon Monica
and Fred keep him busy.

00:11:14.820 --> 00:11:21.650
Cause Monica gets kidnapped, and they save
her, but then Marco’s men kill Fred.

00:11:21.650 --> 00:11:26.950
Fred was the voice for peace and cooperation
between the Belt and inner planets.

00:11:26.950 --> 00:11:30.070
And he was almost like a father figure to
Holden.

00:11:30.070 --> 00:11:36.960
He had just told Holden to live life while
he can – and now he’s dead.

00:11:36.960 --> 00:11:42.490
When Marco’s men steal Fred’s protomolecule
sample, Holden Bull and Monica chase after

00:11:42.490 --> 00:11:43.490
it.

00:11:43.490 --> 00:11:48.590
When they find out Naomi is in danger, Holden
wants to charge in and save her, but realises

00:11:48.590 --> 00:11:54.920
that this time he can’t help her, and the
protomolecule is more important.

00:11:54.920 --> 00:11:59.480
This is the opposite of what happened in Season
2 – when Holden was obsessed with hunting

00:11:59.480 --> 00:12:04.840
down the protomolecule, but then learned to
let it go, cause in that case, saving Naomi

00:12:04.840 --> 00:12:06.800
was more important.

00:12:06.800 --> 00:12:12.350
Once upon a time, Holden was a heroic white
knight who always knew what was right, and

00:12:12.350 --> 00:12:14.800
wanted to save everyone all the time.

00:12:14.800 --> 00:12:22.020
But now he’s more mature and wise, able
to compromise, and make difficult choices

00:12:22.020 --> 00:12:24.630
about what’s right.

00:12:24.630 --> 00:12:30.450
Last season, Drummer left the OPA, cause she
was done with having to sacrifice lives for

00:12:30.450 --> 00:12:32.460
the sake of politics.

00:12:32.460 --> 00:12:37.930
So now she sets her own path – as a polyamorous
space pirate captain.

00:12:37.930 --> 00:12:42.440
She has a family of five other Belters, on
a couple of ships, and extorts people for

00:12:42.440 --> 00:12:44.640
resources in her part of space.

00:12:44.640 --> 00:12:50.730
But like every other character this season,
the past comes back to haunt her.

00:12:50.730 --> 00:12:55.640
She finds the ship of Ashford, who was killed
by Marco last season.

00:12:55.640 --> 00:13:00.360
Previously, Drummer and Ashford had captured
Marco, and would’ve killed him, but Drummer

00:13:00.360 --> 00:13:04.030
spared Marco – leading to Ashford’s death.

00:13:04.030 --> 00:13:09.320
So Drummer suffers grief and guilt over the
death of her friend.

00:13:09.320 --> 00:13:15.700
Drummer has always been so tough and professional,
but now we see her vulnerable intimate side,

00:13:15.700 --> 00:13:18.640
and her relationships with her partners.

00:13:18.640 --> 00:13:24.320
When Marco rises to power with the Free Navy,
Drummer has no choice but to join the man

00:13:24.320 --> 00:13:30.080
who killed two of her friends – her longtime
ally Fred as well as Ashford.

00:13:30.080 --> 00:13:36.740
Drummer’s partner Oksana says for the safety
of their family, they must stay loyal to Marco.

00:13:36.740 --> 00:13:40.800
But then Drummer learns that Naomi is in danger
from Marco.

00:13:40.800 --> 00:13:46.840
Naomi and Drummer survived the Behemoth together,
they danced and handballed together, Naomi

00:13:46.840 --> 00:13:50.130
built Drummer’s robot legs.

00:13:50.130 --> 00:13:54.720
So Drummer won’t let Marco kill another
of her friends.

00:13:54.720 --> 00:14:01.530
She rebels against Marco, attacks his ships,
helps save Naomi, and reclaims her independence,

00:14:01.530 --> 00:14:07.810
but there’s a terrible cost – Marco kills
one of Drummer’s partners, and Oksana blames

00:14:07.810 --> 00:14:12.410
Drummer, so her family breaks apart.

00:14:12.410 --> 00:14:16.600
Last season, Avasarala was the most powerful
person on Earth.

00:14:16.600 --> 00:14:20.920
But after losing her election, she’s relegated
to the moon, and the government doesn’t

00:14:20.920 --> 00:14:22.120
listen to her any more.

00:14:22.120 --> 00:14:27.680
Her daughter says she should go home and patch
things up with her estranged husband Arjun.

00:14:27.680 --> 00:14:33.920
But Avasarala’s whole identity and purpose
is to use politics to protect Earth, and she

00:14:33.920 --> 00:14:38.580
finds evidence of Marco’s plan to throw
stealth rocks at Earth.

00:14:38.580 --> 00:14:41.670
By the time anyone listens, it’s too late.

00:14:41.670 --> 00:14:46.410
Earth is devastated, and Arjun is one of the
dead.

00:14:46.410 --> 00:14:51.830
The new acting Secretary General retaliates
against Marco with an attack that kills thousands

00:14:51.830 --> 00:14:53.720
of Belter civilians.

00:14:53.720 --> 00:14:58.720
In the past, Avasarala probably would’ve
supported this – she agreed to the destruction

00:14:58.720 --> 00:15:03.030
of Deimos in Season 2, and attacked a civilian
ship last season.

00:15:03.030 --> 00:15:07.670
But now, she doesn’t want to repeat the
mistakes of the past.

00:15:07.670 --> 00:15:12.980
Killing civilians will only create more terrorists,
and Avasarala feels responsible to protect

00:15:12.980 --> 00:15:18.780
not just Earthers, but all people, so she
resigns in protest of the attack.

00:15:18.780 --> 00:15:25.220
And it works – others resign with her, the
power shifts, and Avasarala becomes Secretary-General

00:15:25.220 --> 00:15:28.060
again, the once and future queen.

00:15:28.060 --> 00:15:33.970
In the end, she calls for unity among Earth
Mars and the Belt as they face the new threats

00:15:33.970 --> 00:15:37.370
of the Free Navy and Laconia.

00:15:37.370 --> 00:15:43.160
So in Season 5, the sins of the past come
back to punish the protagonists.

00:15:43.160 --> 00:15:49.540
Marco’s Free Navy arose from a century of
oppression of the Belters by Earth and Mars.

00:15:49.540 --> 00:15:54.650
Naomi is almost destroyed by Marco, using
her own computer code.

00:15:54.650 --> 00:16:00.750
Duarte and Laconia’s protomolecule sample
is the one Naomi refused to destroy in Season

00:16:00.750 --> 00:16:01.810
2.

00:16:01.810 --> 00:16:04.270
Naomi fails to save Filip.

00:16:04.270 --> 00:16:07.000
Holden fails to contain the protomolecule.

00:16:07.000 --> 00:16:09.340
Alex fails to repair his past.

00:16:09.340 --> 00:16:11.660
Drummer fails to protect her family.

00:16:11.660 --> 00:16:14.580
Avasarala fails to protect Earth.

00:16:14.580 --> 00:16:20.450
This season is the Empire Strikes Back of
The Expanse, in that the good guys lose.

00:16:20.450 --> 00:16:27.740
If there’s any hope in this story, maybe
it’s in Amos and Clarissa, who emerge from

00:16:27.740 --> 00:16:33.320
trauma and apocalypse with new optimism and
unity.

00:16:33.320 --> 00:16:34.480
Thanks for watching.

00:16:34.480 --> 00:16:38.960
We made four videos for The Expanse Season
5, with the support of our sponsor Amazon

00:16:38.960 --> 00:16:43.340
Prime Video UK – so please check out their
channel at the link below.

